          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "It’s not the strongest swimmer. It wags its tail to lure in its prey and then gulps them down as soon as they get close.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "泳ぐ力は　あまり　強くない。 シッポを　振って　獲物を　呼び寄せ 近寄ったところを　ガブリと　いく。",
